- **Pathfinding Algorithm:** The choice of algorithm and its parameters will significantly impact performance and the quality of the paths found.

This is a high-level overview, and actual implementation details will vary based on your specific requirements, the complexity of your scenes, and the radiance field representation. Experimenting with simpler scenes and pathfinding algorithms can help you get started.

