### Using Flakes (if applicable)

If you're using Nix flakes, your `flake.nix` might look something like this:

```nix
{
  description = "LLVM 17 Development Environment";
  inputs = {
    nixpkgs.url = "github:NixOS/nixpkgs/nixpkgs-unstable";
  };

  outputs = { self, nixpkgs }:
    let
      pkgs = import nixpkgs { system = "x86_64-linux"; }; # Adjust the system as necessary
